ens_list):\n    if not isinstance(tokens_list, list):\n        return []\n    stemmed = []\n    for word in tokens_list:\n        if \"_\" in word:\n            parts = word.split(\"_\")\n            stemmed_parts = [stemmer.stem(p) for p in parts]\n            stemmed.append(\"_\".join(stemmed_parts))\n        else:\n            stemmed.append(stemmer.stem(word))\n    return stemmed\n\ndf['text_final'] = df['text_stop'].apply(stem_text)\n\nprint(\"Setelah Stemming (text_final):\")\ndisplay(df[['text_stop', 'text_final']].head(10))","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-07T10:33:25.845875Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-07T10:33:25.846096Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-07T10:57:12.982316Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-09-07T10:33:25.846074Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-07T10:57:12.981604Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Setelah Stemming (text_final):\n","output_type":"stream"},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"                                           text_stop  \\\n0  [gajelas, pesen, jam, belum_dikirim, chat, adm...   \n1  [voucher, potongan, harga, aplikasi, hilang, p...   \n2                             [halah, gabisa, kirim]   \n3  [langganan, padahal, tp, makin, kesini, pengir...   \n4                 [pesanan, tidak_sesuai, dikorupsi]   \n5  [pelayanan, bang, ngga, barang, minta, refound...   \n6  [cs, alfagift, lama, bgt, pesanan, dicancel, t...   \n7  [apa²an, produk, tidak_tersedia, wilayah, pada...   \n8                                      [aman, rumah]   \n9                                  [sangat, menarik]   \n\n                                          text_final  \n0  [gajelas, sen, jam, belum_kirim, chat, adminny...  \n1  [voucher, potong, harga, aplikasi, hilang, pad...  \n2                             [halah, gabisa, kirim]  \n3  [langgan, padahal, tp, makin, kesini, kirim, s...  \n4                     [pesan, tidak_sesuai, korupsi]  \n5  [layan, bang, ngga, barang, minta, refou